# Dockerfile-specific ignore for the sharded-test-server image.
#
# This build DOES need cmd/test-server and cmd/sharded-test-server in the
# context (the whole point of the image is to ship the sharded test server),
# so, unlike the repository-root .dockerignore used by the production kcp
# image, it does not exclude them. It still excludes the same build artifacts
# and workspace files. Patterns are evaluated relative to the build context
# root (the repository root), not this file's directory.
#
# BuildKit (docker build) auto-detects this file as <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# and it overrides the root .dockerignore. The Prow/buildah build passes it
# explicitly via --ignorefile.

bin/

go.work
go.work.sum
